  "budget": 0.7,
  "budgetReason": "The board's note shows the placeholder token \"[Instructing solicitor]\" in its first sentence and the literal words \"the solicitor\" in its last; the page prints the pack's word for the instructing party in both places (rule 11 forbids writing it in code), so the paragraph reflows. That paragraph is 0.53% of the screen; the rest of the screen matches exactly apart from the shared case bar (0.14%).",
  "deviations": [
    "The note names the instructing party from the pack (here \"solicitor\") where the board prints a placeholder token, so its wording reflows (rule 11).",
    "The signature image is the saved picture from the API (mocked with the board's drawing); it is drawn 200 by 60 inside the board's 80px box.",
    "The document card's title is the report version's name from the API, mocked as the board's words (\"Breach of duty report: Mrs A\").",
    "The board's confirm box is drawn checked, so the setup ticks it; the page starts unticked.",
    "The note's lock icon shrinks beside the text on the artboard (a flex bug in the canvas); the page keeps it at 22px and the artboard is rendered with flex:none for comparison.",
    "The two download buttons and the main button keep the board's sizes (51.5 to 64px tall); the confirm box's hit area is widened to 52px with a pseudo-element."
  ]
}
